              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class='lp-proof-header'><div class='lp-proof-eyebrow'>What families say</div><h2 class='lp-proof-title'>The moments<br>that <em>stayed.</em></h2></div><div class='lp-proof-grid'><div class='lp-proof-card'><div class='lp-proof-stars'><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg></div><p class='lp-proof-text'>&ldquo;My seven-year-old asks for a card every morning now. She calls it her &lsquo;feeling check.&rsquo; I didn&rsquo;t teach her that — the deck did.&rdquo;</p><div class='lp-proof-author'><span>M.L. · Mom of two · Vancouver</span><span>Mini Moments</span></div></div><div class='lp-proof-card'><div class='lp-proof-stars'><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg></div><p class='lp-proof-text'>&ldquo;The question cards made me realise how rarely I say the things I actually feel about my kids. The conversations from one card are ones I&rsquo;ll remember forever.&rdquo;</p><div class='lp-proof-author'><span>R.K. · Dad · Calgary</span><span>In This Little Life</span></div></div><div class='lp-proof-card'><div class='lp-proof-stars'><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg><svg class='lp-proof-star' viewBox='0 0 24 24'><polygon points='12,2 15.09,8.26 22,9.27 17,14.14 18.18,21.02 12,17.77 5.82,21.02 7,14.14 2,9.27 8.91,8.26'/></svg></div><p class='lp-proof-text'>&ldquo;I bought both as gifts and kept them for us. I use the affirmation cards too — turns out adults need them just as much as kids do.&rdquo;</p><div class='lp-proof-author'><span>A.T. · Aunt + educator · Toronto</span><span>Both decks</span></div></div></div><style>*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}.lp-proof-header{margin-bottom:4rem}.lp-proof-eyebrow{font-family:'Lato',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.62rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#688F9D;margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.8rem